  %% A loop around feature work
  define["Define observable<br/>behavior"] --> attempt["Agent attempts<br/>a change<br/>Reads, edits,<br/>uses tools"]
  attempt --> check["Check the<br/>behavior"]
  check -->|Pass| inspect["Inspect + record<br/>result<br/>Then continue<br/>or finish"]
  check -->|Retry| attempt
  check --> stop["Fail at<br/>limit:<br/>investigate"]
